  "answerAnalysis": "\n\n\nSevenkplus\n\n\n\n将碎片组合成单词或词组。每个单词或词组都需要加上两对相同的字母。结果如下表。\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n    <table class=\"solution-table\">\n        <tr>\n            <td>线索</td>\n            <td>单词或词组</td>\n            <td>插入的字母</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>动物</td>\n            <td>HIP[PO][PO]TAMUS</td>\n            <td>PO</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>国家</td>\n            <td>[TA]JIKIS[TA]N</td>\n            <td>TA</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>美国州</td>\n            <td>MI[SS]I[SS]IPPI</td>\n            <td>SS</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>古罗马军事家</td>\n            <td>GA[IU]SMAR[IU]S</td>\n            <td>IU</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>布拉德·皮特主演电影</td>\n            <td>[MR]AND[MR]SSMITH</td>\n            <td>MR</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>群岛</td>\n            <td>R[YU]K[YU]ISLANDS</td>\n            <td>YU</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>西班牙省份</td>\n            <td>[ZA]RAGO[ZA]</td>\n            <td>ZA</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>日本料理</td>\n            <td>SU[KI]YA[KI]</td>\n            <td>KI</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>幻之宝可梦</td>\n            <td>[ME]L[ME]TAL</td>\n            <td>ME</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>航天器</td>\n            <td>SA[TE]LLI[TE]</td>\n            <td>TE</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>体育项目</td>\n            <td>MA[RT]IALA[RT]S</td>\n            <td>RT</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>文学名著</td>\n            <td>GONE[WI]THTHE[WI]ND</td>\n            <td>WI</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>披头士歌曲</td>\n            <td>GE[TT]INGBE[TT]ER</td>\n            <td>TT</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>仪器</td>\n            <td>TH[ER]MOMET[ER]</td>\n            <td>ER</td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n将插入的字母连起来，得到四个单词 POTASSIUM RYUZAKI METER TWITTER。\n\n每个单词都对应一个字母，转换后得到四个字母 KLMX。\n\n插入一对相同的字母后得到答案 **KARL MARX** 。\n\n\n"
